# Workers assets only. The SPA rewrite in `_redirects` is Cloudflare Pages'
# mechanism; the Worker's equivalent is `not_found_handling:
# "single-page-application"` in wrangler.jsonc. Shipping the rule to the
# Worker makes Cloudflare reject the deploy with an infinite-loop error
# (100324), because its clean-URL handling strips `/index.html` straight
# back into the `/*` rule. So the file stays behind, with Pages.
_redirects
